    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Lithium Cell Chemistries — LFP, NMC, NCA, LTO, LMFP | World Battery Hub</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Lithium cell chemistry reference — LFP, NMC, NCA, LTO and LMFP with nominal voltage, cell-level energy density, cycle life and temperature window, all as typical ranges with sources." />
    <link rel="canonical" href={`${SITE}/chemistries/`} />
    <style>
      body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6; }
